        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>绕口令</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    min-height: 100%;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 723px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 33px 21px 17px 21px;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 5px solid #37a8d1;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #d8f2f8;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .content {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    column-gap: 45px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  .column {\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .poem {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .poem + .poem {\n    margin-top: 23px;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 13px 5px;\n    color: #4879cf;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n  }\n  .text {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #383838;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 24.1px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  .sun {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 5px;\n    left: 6px;\n    width: 27px;\n    height: 31px;\n    color: #f6d42e;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n  .sun .core {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 13px;\n    height: 13px;\n    left: 7px;\n    top: 8px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f7cf18;\n  }\n  .sun .ray {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 3px;\n    height: 8px;\n    background: #f6d42e;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    transform-origin: 1px 11px;\n    left: 12px;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n  .sun .r1 { transform: rotate(0deg); }\n  .sun .r2 { transform: rotate(45deg); }\n  .sun .r3 { transform: rotate(90deg); }\n  .sun .r4 { transform: rotate(135deg); }\n  .sun .r5 { transform: rotate(180deg); }\n  .sun .r6 { transform: rotate(225deg); }\n  .sun .r7 { transform: rotate(270deg); }\n  .sun .r8 { transform: rotate(315deg); }\n  .cup {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 7px;\n    bottom: 5px;\n    width: 31px;\n    height: 60px;\n    z-index: 1;\n    opacity: .82;\n  }\n  .cup .glass {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 2px;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 21px;\n    height: 40px;\n    border: 2px solid #4eb7d7;\n    border-radius: 4px 4px 7px 7px;\n    transform: skewY(5deg);\n  }\n  .cup .glass:after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 1px;\n    right: 1px;\n    bottom: 11px;\n    border-top: 2px solid #73c7dd;\n  }\n  .cup .straw {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 3px;\n    height: 59px;\n    background: #4eb7d7;\n    right: 5px;\n    bottom: 4px;\n    transform: rotate(14deg);\n  }\n  .cup .straw:after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 11px;\n    height: 3px;\n    background: #4eb7d7;\n    top: -1px;\n    left: -7px;\n    transform: rotate(-35deg);\n  }\n  .cup .line {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 31px;\n    border-top: 2px solid #4eb7d7;\n    left: 0;\n    bottom: 28px;\n    transform: rotate(14deg);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"sun placeholder\" aria-label=\"[装饰：左上角太阳]\">\n    <span class=\"core\"></span>\n    <span class=\"ray r1\"></span><span class=\"ray r2\"></span><span class=\"ray r3\"></span><span class=\"ray r4\"></span>\n    <span class=\"ray r5\"></span><span class=\"ray r6\"></span><span class=\"ray r7\"></span><span class=\"ray r8\"></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <main class=\"content\">\n    <section class=\"column\">\n      <article class=\"poem\">\n        <h2>《猫吃桃》</h2>\n        <p class=\"text\">河边有座窑，<br>窑上有个槽，<br>槽里放件袍，<br>袍包个桃。<br>对岸有只猫，<br>想吃窑上槽里袍包桃，<br>可惜岸上没有桥。<br>过不了河，<br>上不了窑，<br>够不着槽，<br>咬不住袍，<br>吃不了桃。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"poem\">\n        <h2>《姥姥有个宝宝》</h2>\n        <p class=\"text\">姥姥有个宝宝，<br>宝宝有个姥姥，<br>姥姥疼爱宝宝，<br>宝宝喜爱姥姥。<br>姥姥天天抱宝宝，<br>宝宝天天来姥姥，<br>姥姥老，走不好，<br>抱着宝宝摔一跤，<br>跌了姥姥，摔了宝宝，<br>宝宝连忙扶姥姥，<br>姥姥赶快抱宝宝。</p>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"column\">\n      <article class=\"poem\">\n        <h2>《数青蛙》</h2>\n        <p class=\"text\">一只青蛙一张嘴，<br>两只眼睛四条腿，<br>扑通一声跳下水。<br>两只青蛙两张嘴，<br>四只眼睛八条腿，<br>扑通扑通两声跳下水。<br>三只青蛙三张嘴，<br>六只眼睛十二条腿，<br>扑通扑通三声跳下水。<br>四只青蛙四张嘴，<br>八只眼睛十六条腿，<br>扑通扑通扑通四声跳下水。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"poem\">\n        <h2>《南南有个篮》</h2>\n        <p class=\"text\">南南有个篮篮，<br>篮篮装着碗碗，<br>盘盘放着碗碗，<br>碗碗盛着饭饭。<br>南南翻了篮篮，<br>篮篮扣了碗碗，<br>盘盘打了碗碗，<br>碗碗撒了饭饭。</p>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <div class=\"cup placeholder\" aria-label=\"[装饰：右下角饮料杯]\">\n    <span class=\"glass\"></span>\n    <span class=\"straw\"></span>\n    <span class=\"line\"></span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
